From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Libre Core AutoLoader <firmware-build@localhost.invalid>
Date: Tue, 1 Jan 2030 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] x86: use output-target for the x86_64 EFI application

The pinned U-Boot v2024.10 source has GNU objcopy's input/output option in
the wrong position for its x86_64 EFI application conversion. Keep the ia32
target unchanged and use the documented output-target spelling for x86_64.

---
 arch/x86/config.mk | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/x86/config.mk b/arch/x86/config.mk
--- a/arch/x86/config.mk
+++ b/arch/x86/config.mk
@@ -129,3 +129,3 @@
 ifdef CONFIG_X86_64
-EFI_TARGET := --target=efi-app-x86_64
+EFI_TARGET := --output-target=efi-app-x86_64
 else
-- 
2.0.0
